Object.assign(catalogs.fr,{"Choose front and back photos after capture or import. An A4 page is added; originals are kept.": "Choisissez les photos recto et verso. Une page A4 est ajoutée ; les originaux sont conservés.", "Adjust each side later using Two pages into one.": "Ajustez chaque face avec Deux pages en une.", "A new copy is added. Original pages are kept.": "Une nouvelle copie est ajoutée. Les originaux sont conservés.", "Center line is estimated. Adjust it before splitting. This tool does not flatten curved paper.": "Ligne centrale estimée. Ajustez-la avant de diviser. Cet outil ne redresse pas les pages courbes.", "Location is requested only when tapped. Added coordinates appear in the exported image.": "Localisation demandée uniquement au clic. Les coordonnées ajoutées apparaissent dans l’image exportée.", "Center crop and print template; no automatic background removal. Check the destination photo requirements.": "Recadrage central et modèle d’impression ; sans suppression automatique du fond. Vérifiez les exigences de photo.", "Combine ordered parts with adjustable overlap. No automatic perspective matching or guaranteed engineering measurements.": "Combinez des parties ordonnées avec chevauchement réglable. Sans correspondance automatique de perspective ni garantie de mesure.", "Large images are split into multiple files to limit memory use.": "Les grandes images sont divisées pour limiter la mémoire.", "Each page becomes an image slide. Text inside images remains uneditable.": "Chaque page devient une diapositive-image. Le texte reste non modifiable.", "The basic assistant shows saved text excerpts, not generated answers. Each result links to its page.": "L’assistant de base affiche des extraits enregistrés, sans générer de réponses. Chaque résultat renvoie à sa page.", "Rule-based extraction of simple equations from saved OCR. Complex fractions and handwriting require a specialized Math OCR model not currently included.": "Extraction de simples équations à partir d’OCR enregistré. Fractions complexes et manuscrits nécessitent un modèle spécialisé non inclus.", "Fill a rectangle using its boundary color, suitable for simple backgrounds. It does not restore removed detail or provide secure redaction.": "Remplissage avec la couleur du contour, pour fonds simples. Sans restauration de détails ni masquage sécurisé.", "Sign-in is optional. Use Waraqa locally without an account.": "Connexion facultative. Utilisez Waraqa localement sans compte.", "System shortcuts depend on browser support. Web processing resumes when the app reopens.": "Raccourcis selon le navigateur. Le traitement web reprend à la réouverture.", "Recent": "Récents"});
Object.assign(catalogs.de,{"Choose front and back photos after capture or import. An A4 page is added; originals are kept.": "Vorder- und Rückseitenfoto auswählen. Eine A4-Seite wird hinzugefügt; Originale bleiben erhalten.", "Adjust each side later using Two pages into one.": "Positionen mit Zwei Seiten in einer anpassen.", "A new copy is added. Original pages are kept.": "Eine neue Kopie wird hinzugefügt. Originalseiten bleiben erhalten.", "Center line is estimated. Adjust it before splitting. This tool does not flatten curved paper.": "Mittellinie ist geschätzt. Vor dem Teilen anpassen. Gekrümmtes Papier wird nicht entzerrt.", "Location is requested only when tapped. Added coordinates appear in the exported image.": "Standort wird nur beim Antippen angefordert. Koordinaten erscheinen im exportierten Bild.", "Center crop and print template; no automatic background removal. Check the destination photo requirements.": "Mittiger Zuschnitt und Druckvorlage; keine automatische Hintergrundentfernung. Fotoanforderungen prüfen.", "Combine ordered parts with adjustable overlap. No automatic perspective matching or guaranteed engineering measurements.": "Geordnete Teile mit einstellbarer Überlappung verbinden. Kein automatischer Perspektivabgleich oder garantierte Messgenauigkeit.", "Large images are split into multiple files to limit memory use.": "Große Bilder werden zur Speicherbegrenzung aufgeteilt.", "Each page becomes an image slide. Text inside images remains uneditable.": "Jede Seite wird eine Bildfolie. Bildtext bleibt nicht bearbeitbar.", "The basic assistant shows saved text excerpts, not generated answers. Each result links to its page.": "Der Basisassistent zeigt gespeicherte Auszüge, keine generierten Antworten. Jedes Ergebnis verweist auf seine Seite.", "Rule-based extraction of simple equations from saved OCR. Complex fractions and handwriting require a specialized Math OCR model not currently included.": "Regelbasierte Extraktion einfacher Gleichungen aus OCR. Komplexe Brüche und Handschrift benötigen ein nicht enthaltenes Spezialmodell.", "Fill a rectangle using its boundary color, suitable for simple backgrounds. It does not restore removed detail or provide secure redaction.": "Rechteck mit Randfarbe füllen, für einfache Hintergründe. Keine Detailwiederherstellung oder sichere Schwärzung.", "Sign-in is optional. Use Waraqa locally without an account.": "Anmeldung ist optional. Waraqa lokal ohne Konto verwenden.", "System shortcuts depend on browser support. Web processing resumes when the app reopens.": "Systemkürzel hängen vom Browser ab. Webverarbeitung wird beim Öffnen fortgesetzt.", "Recent": "Zuletzt verwendet"});
Object.assign(catalogs.es,{"Choose front and back photos after capture or import. An A4 page is added; originals are kept.": "Elige las fotos de ambas caras. Se añade una página A4 y se conservan los originales.", "Adjust each side later using Two pages into one.": "Ajusta cada cara con Dos páginas en una.", "A new copy is added. Original pages are kept.": "Se añade una copia nueva. Se conservan las páginas originales.", "Center line is estimated. Adjust it before splitting. This tool does not flatten curved paper.": "Línea central estimada. Ajústala antes de dividir. Esta herramienta no aplana papel curvado.", "Location is requested only when tapped. Added coordinates appear in the exported image.": "La ubicación se solicita al pulsar. Las coordenadas aparecen en la imagen exportada.", "Center crop and print template; no automatic background removal. Check the destination photo requirements.": "Recorte central y plantilla de impresión; sin quitar el fondo automáticamente. Revisa los requisitos de foto.", "Combine ordered parts with adjustable overlap. No automatic perspective matching or guaranteed engineering measurements.": "Combina partes ordenadas con superposición ajustable. Sin ajuste automático de perspectiva ni garantía de medición.", "Large images are split into multiple files to limit memory use.": "Las imágenes grandes se dividen para limitar la memoria.", "Each page becomes an image slide. Text inside images remains uneditable.": "Cada página es una diapositiva de imagen. El texto no se vuelve editable.", "The basic assistant shows saved text excerpts, not generated answers. Each result links to its page.": "El asistente básico muestra fragmentos guardados, no respuestas generadas. Cada resultado enlaza su página.", "Rule-based extraction of simple equations from saved OCR. Complex fractions and handwriting require a specialized Math OCR model not currently included.": "Extracción por reglas de ecuaciones simples del OCR guardado. Fracciones complejas y escritura manual requieren un modelo especializado no incluido.", "Fill a rectangle using its boundary color, suitable for simple backgrounds. It does not restore removed detail or provide secure redaction.": "Rellena un rectángulo con el color del borde. No restaura detalles ni ofrece ocultación segura.", "Sign-in is optional. Use Waraqa locally without an account.": "El inicio de sesión es opcional. Usa Waraqa localmente sin cuenta.", "System shortcuts depend on browser support. Web processing resumes when the app reopens.": "Los atajos dependen del navegador. El procesamiento web se reanuda al abrir.", "Recent": "Recientes"});
Object.assign(catalogs.tr,{"Choose front and back photos after capture or import. An A4 page is added; originals are kept.": "Ön ve arka fotoğrafları seçin. A4 sayfa eklenir; orijinaller korunur.", "Adjust each side later using Two pages into one.": "Her yüzü İki sayfayı birleştir aracıyla ayarlayın.", "A new copy is added. Original pages are kept.": "Yeni kopya eklenir. Orijinal sayfalar korunur.", "Center line is estimated. Adjust it before splitting. This tool does not flatten curved paper.": "Orta çizgi tahminidir. Bölmeden önce ayarlayın. Bu araç kavisli kağıdı düzleştirmez.", "Location is requested only when tapped. Added coordinates appear in the exported image.": "Konum yalnızca dokununca istenir. Eklenen koordinatlar aktarılan görselde görünür.", "Center crop and print template; no automatic background removal. Check the destination photo requirements.": "Ortadan kırpma ve baskı şablonu; otomatik arka plan kaldırma yok. Fotoğraf koşullarını kontrol edin.", "Combine ordered parts with adjustable overlap. No automatic perspective matching or guaranteed engineering measurements.": "Sıralı parçaları ayarlanabilir örtüşmeyle birleştirin. Otomatik perspektif eşleme veya ölçüm garantisi yok.", "Large images are split into multiple files to limit memory use.": "Büyük görseller bellek kullanımını sınırlamak için bölünür.", "Each page becomes an image slide. Text inside images remains uneditable.": "Her sayfa görsel slayt olur. Görseldeki metin düzenlenebilir olmaz.", "The basic assistant shows saved text excerpts, not generated answers. Each result links to its page.": "Temel asistan üretilmiş yanıt değil, kayıtlı alıntılar gösterir. Her sonuç sayfasına bağlanır.", "Rule-based extraction of simple equations from saved OCR. Complex fractions and handwriting require a specialized Math OCR model not currently included.": "Kayıtlı OCR’den basit denklemlerin kural tabanlı çıkarılması. Karmaşık kesirler ve el yazısı dahil olmayan özel model gerektirir.", "Fill a rectangle using its boundary color, suitable for simple backgrounds. It does not restore removed detail or provide secure redaction.": "Dikdörtgeni sınır rengiyle doldurur; basit arka planlar içindir. Ayrıntı kurtarma veya güvenli karartma sağlamaz.", "Sign-in is optional. Use Waraqa locally without an account.": "Giriş isteğe bağlı. Waraqa’yı hesap olmadan yerel kullanın.", "System shortcuts depend on browser support. Web processing resumes when the app reopens.": "Sistem kısayolları tarayıcıya bağlıdır. Web işlemi uygulama açılınca sürer.", "Recent": "Son kullanılanlar"});

